  {
    "number": 41,
    "title": "直播间左下角的点赞数到底是怎么算的？",
    "url": "https://github.com/zbgamelt/zbgamelt.github.io/discussions/41",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T08:05:00Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-09-19T12:31:00Z",
    "bodyHTML": "<p>看直播的时候盯着点赞数看了半天，感觉它不是固定每秒涨几个，像是跟在线人数有关系。</p>\n<p>有没有人知道具体规则？还是说纯随机？</p>",
    "author": {
      "login": "newbie-live",
      "url": "https://github.com/newbie-live",
      "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2?v=4"
    },
    "category": {
      "name": "问答",
      "emoji": "🙋"
    },
    "comments": {
      "totalCount": 1,
      "nodes": [
        {
          "createdAt": "2026-09-19T12:31:00Z",
          "isAnswer": true,
          "bodyHTML": "<p>不是随机。按在线人数的约 <code>1/10</code> 每秒增长，120 人在线差不多每秒 12 个。</p>\n<p>而且这个数会写进直播状态，中途重启直播也能接着涨，不会归零。</p>",
          "author": {
            "login": "zbgamelt",
            "url": "https://github.com/zbgamelt",
            "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297119334?v=4"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
