  {
    "number": 39,
    "title": "[反馈] WiFi 切 4G 之后，私信偶尔要等十来秒才重连",
    "url": "https://github.com/zbgamelt/zbgamelt.github.io/discussions/39",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-16T11:20:00Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-09-17T02:05:00Z",
    "bodyHTML": "<p>现象：在家里用 WiFi 发私信正常，出门切到 4G 之后再发，有时候要等十几秒才收到回信，中间也没有任何提示。</p>\n<p>切回 WiFi 又立刻好了。试了三次，两次能重现。</p>",
    "author": {
      "login": "night-walker",
      "url": "https://github.com/night-walker",
      "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4?v=4"
    },
    "category": {
      "name": "反馈",
      "emoji": "🐞"
    },
    "comments": {
      "totalCount": 2,
      "nodes": [
        {
          "createdAt": "2026-09-16T15:02:00Z",
          "isAnswer": false,
          "bodyHTML": "<p>我用流量也遇到过，感觉是断线之后没自动续上，得退到列表页再进去一次。</p>",
          "author": {
            "login": "collector-w",
            "url": "https://github.com/collector-w",
            "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3?v=4"
          }
        },
        {
          "createdAt": "2026-09-17T02:05:00Z",
          "isAnswer": false,
          "bodyHTML": "<p>定位到了：网络切换后连接断掉没有触发重连，只有手动进会话才会重建。已经改成掉线自动重连 + 心跳保活，下个版本可以验一下。</p>",
          "author": {
            "login": "zbgamelt",
            "url": "https://github.com/zbgamelt",
            "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297119334?v=4"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
