      "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2?v=4"
    },
    "category": {
      "name": "闲聊",
      "emoji": "💬"
    },
    "comments": {
      "totalCount": 3,
      "nodes": [
        {
          "createdAt": "2026-09-15T10:11:00Z",
          "isAnswer": false,
          "bodyHTML": "<p>欢迎！先把新人任务做完，成就解锁会快很多。</p>",
          "author": {
            "login": "collector-w",
            "url": "https://github.com/collector-w",
            "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3?v=4"
          }
        },
        {
          "createdAt": "2026-09-15T11:50:00Z",
          "isAnswer": false,
          "bodyHTML": "<p>公会频道在游戏里点右上角就能看到，加的时候报个活跃时段一般都会收。</p>",
          "author": {
            "login": "mawqer123",
            "url": "https://github.com/mawqer123",
            "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1?v=4"
          }
        },
        {
          "createdAt": "2026-09-15T13:44:00Z",
          "isAnswer": false,
          "bodyHTML": "<p>要是想直播数据好看点，记得早点开播、时长拉满，点赞数是按在线人数慢慢滚的。</p>",
          "author": {
            "login": "night-walker",
            "url": "https://github.com/night-walker",
            "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4?v=4"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
